5,0,1,talk,Toshio,,Let's begin. We need a systematic approach to identify the werewolf. I suggest we observe speech patterns and contradictions carefully.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Efficiency is key. We should decide if the Seer should reveal themselves early or stay hidden to avoid being targeted.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,Revealing the Seer too early is risky. The werewolf will simply kill them. It's more logical to gather behavioral data first.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Minato,,I think whatever everyone agrees on is best. I just want us all to get along while we find the bad person.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,I'll be watching how everyone reacts to the pressure. The truth often hides in the small hesitations of a voice.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Misaki, regarding your point on efficiency, if the Seer stays hidden, we lose the ability to act on confirmed information immediately.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"True, but the loss of the Seer is a permanent disadvantage. A cautious approach is more sustainable.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Exactly. If we analyze the logic of each claim, we can narrow down the suspects without risking our most valuable asset.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Minato,,Mizuki seems very sure of herself. I think following her lead might be a good idea.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,It is interesting how quickly some are taking charge. I wonder who is truly comfortable in this silence.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Toshio,,I will be monitoring the consistency of your statements. Any slip in logic will be noted.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,That's a fair method. Let's focus on who tries too hard to blend in or who pushes a narrative too aggressively.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I'm simply suggesting a logical framework. @Jonathan, you're very quiet. Are you observing, or are you hiding something?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Minato,,I'm sure Jonathan is just thinking! He seems very peaceful.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I am merely listening to the harmony of the group. The dissonance usually reveals the liar.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Toshio,,We have a basic strategy. Observation and logical consistency. I'm satisfied for now.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
